<title>SWEDEN: Skandia says no plans for better bid.</title>
<headline>Skandia says no plans for better bid.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish insurance company Skandia said on Thursday it did not have any plans to increase its offer for mortgage bank Stadshypotek following a rival bid by high street bank Handelsbanken.</p>
</text>
